            "fa": "بسته‌بندی زیادی استفاده می‌شه."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b1_everyday_environment_cause_effect_env",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-everyday-environment-03",
        "slug": "b1-everyday-environment-cause-effect-env",
        "title": "Cause and effect links",
        "rule_summary": "Use because, so, therefore, which, and as a result to explain environmental impact clearly.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای توضیح اثر محیط‌زیستی از because، so، therefore، which و as a result استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "We planned meals, so we wasted less food.",
            "fa": "برنامه غذایی چیدیم، پس غذای کمتری هدر دادیم."
