    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_b1_everyday_environment_office",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-everyday-environment-01",
        "title": "Reducing office waste",
        "setting": "team meeting",
        "cefr": "B1",
        "topic": "common-actions",
        "characters": [
          "Lina",
          "Ben"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Lina",
            "text": "We still use a lot of disposable cups in the office.",
            "translation_fa": "هنوز توی دفتر لیوان یک‌بارمصرف زیادی استفاده می‌کنیم."
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Ben",
            "text": "What if we gave everyone a reusable mug?",
            "translation_fa": "چی می‌شه اگر به همه لیوان قابل‌استفاده مجدد بدیم؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Lina",
            "text": "That could help, but we also need somewhere easy to wash them.",
            "translation_fa": "می‌تونه کمک کنه، ولی جایی راحت برای شستن هم لازم داریم."
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Ben",
            "text": "Good point. Let's include that in the plan.",
            "translation_fa": "نکته خوبیه. توی برنامه بذاریمش."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_b1_everyday_environment_commute",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-everyday-environment-02",
        "title": "Talking about commuting",
        "setting": "bus stop",
        "cefr": "B1",
        "topic": "common-actions",
        "characters": [
          "Amir",
          "Ella"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "I'd use the bus more if it came every fifteen minutes.",
            "translation_fa": "اگر اتوبوس هر پانزده دقیقه می‌اومد بیشتر استفاده می‌کردم."
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Same. Right now driving is just much more practical.",
            "translation_fa": "منم. الان رانندگی خیلی عملی‌تره."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "That's the problem. People need a realistic alternative.",
            "translation_fa": "مشکل همینه. مردم به جایگزین واقعی نیاز دارند."
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Exactly. Telling people to drive less isn't enough by itself.",
            "translation_fa": "دقیقاً. فقط گفتن کمتر رانندگی کنید کافی نیست."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
